\viewkind4\uc1\pard\lang1033\b\fs24 Playwright Feature Summary\b0\par
\par
Project purpose: practice Playwright Java using local mock pages and a real browser scenario.\par
\par
\b Core topics covered:\b0\par
\bullet Locators: page.locator, getByRole, getByText, getByTestId, chaining\par
\bullet Actions: click, type, fill, selectOption, check, uncheck, press, hover\par
\bullet Assertions: toBeVisible, toHaveText, toContainText, expect(locator)\par
\bullet Waiting: waitForSelector, waitForLoadState, visibility waits\par
\bullet Navigation: goto, reload, back, forward\par
\bullet Frames and dialogs: iframe content and alert handling\par
\bullet Network / API interception: mock requests and validate responses\par
\bullet Browser contexts / multi-page: separate page and context examples\par
\bullet Authentication / storageState: browser storage persistence\par
\bullet Screenshots / videos / tracing: capture evidence and debug flows\par
\bullet Page Object Model: selectors and actions separated from steps\par
\par
\b Feature structure:\b0\par
\bullet BrowserSetupSteps.java: shared browser setup and page launch\par
\bullet BasicPageSteps.java: title and page text checks\par
\bullet LocatorSteps.java: locator-based validation\par
\bullet ActionSteps.java: form and button interactions\par
\bullet WaitingSteps.java: waits and expected visibility checks\par
\bullet NavigationSteps.java: page transitions and reload behavior\par
\bullet FramesAndDialogsSteps.java: modal and iframe examples\par
\bullet NetworkApiSteps.java: request interception and mock validation\par
\bullet BrowserContextSteps.java: multi-page examples\par
\bullet AuthenticationSteps.java: storage-state reuse pattern\par
\bullet ScreenshotTraceSteps.java: screenshots and traces\par
\bullet WikipediaActionSteps.java: real browser scenario using Wikipedia\par
\bullet PlaywrightContext.java: shared Playwright/browser/page state\par
\par
\b Mock pages used:\b0\par
\bullet src/test/resources/pages/dummy-browser.html\par
\bullet src/test/resources/pages/advanced-browser.html\par
\par
\b Real browser scenario:\b0\par
\bullet Wikipedia search in headed browser mode for visual validation\par
\par
\b Notes:\b0\par
\bullet The project is structured by topic and feature, not as a single monolithic flow.\par
\bullet Local mock pages make tests stable and offline-friendly.\par
\bullet Cucumber feature files under src/test/resources/features cover the scenarios.\par
\par
Prepared for the Playwright Java project.\par
}\par
